NETWORK
  EXECUTE
x := 1;
  END_EXECUTE => y;
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_BAD_EXPRESSION has no output pin

#### missing-semicolon — a line no deeper than its item's first line starts a new item
=== text
IMPLEMENTATION LD
NETWORK
  x := a
  y := b;
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_PARSE missing `;`?

#### missing-semicolon-before-end — END_NETWORK ends the item
=== text
IMPLEMENTATION LD
NETWORK
  x := a
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_PARSE missing `;`?

#### dot-eno — `.ENO` is no spelling: a box read through its ENO shows ENO
=== scope
instance t1 TON
=== text
IMPLEMENTATION LD
NETWORK
  x := t1 : TON(IN := a).ENO;
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_PARSE `.ENO` is not network text

#### fb-without-type — an FB instance's call names its type
=== scope
instance t1 TON
=== text
IMPLEMENTATION LD
NETWORK
  t1(IN := a);
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_BAD_EXPRESSION its call names its type

#### fb-wrong-type — the type an instance's call names is its declaration's
=== scope
instance t1 TON
=== text
IMPLEMENTATION LD
NETWORK
  t1 : TOF(IN := a);
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_BAD_EXPRESSION is declared a

#### lone-jump-without-coil — a jump is a coil: `JMP l := ;`
=== text
IMPLEMENTATION LD
NETWORK
  JMP Done;
END_NETWORK
NETWORK LABEL: Done
  ;
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_BAD_EXPRESSION a jump or a return is a coil

#### lone-return-without-coil — `RETURN := ;`
=== text
IMPLEMENTATION LD
NETWORK
  RETURN;
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_BAD_EXPRESSION a jump or a return is a coil

