=== text
IMPLEMENTATION LD
NETWORK
  NOT x S= c;
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_BAD_EXPRESSION write `x R=

#### negated-reset-coil — a negated reset coil is no coil the IDE stores apart from the reset coil
=== text
IMPLEMENTATION LD
NETWORK
  NOT x R= c;
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_BAD_EXPRESSION a negated reset coil

